{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20018","headline":"连州吟 一 · 孟郊","name":"连州吟 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春风朝夕起，吹绿日日深。\n试爲连州吟，泪下不可禁。\n连山何连连，连天碧岑岑。\n哀猿哭花死，子规裂客心。\n兰芷结新佩，潇湘遗旧音。\n怨声能翦弦，坐抚零落琴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20018.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20018","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}